~ start
set State.in_dialogue = true

Receptionist: Hello, how may I help you?

- I have an appointment with Mr. Floyd.
	Receptionist: Your name, sir?

	- Milton
		Receptionist: Appointment for Mr. Milton. Take the elevator to the (6)7th floor, sir.
		set State.finished_rec_dialogue = true
		set State.in_dialogue = false
		set State.elevator_route = true
		set State.objective = "Go To The Target's Office"
		set State.show_consequences = true
		=> END

	- Err... Sam
		Receptionist: I don't see any appointments with the name Sam. Please make an appointment and come back.
		set State.finished_rec_dialogue = true
		set State.killRec = true
		set State.in_dialogue = false
		set State.objective = "Kill The Receptionist"
		set State.show_consequences = true
		=> END

- Pest Control, Mr. Floyd's Office.
	Receptionist: Hold on, sir...
	Receptionist: Mr. Floyd didn't order pest control. I have alerted the police.
	set State.lost = true
	set State.finished_rec_dialogue = true
	set State.in_dialogue = false
	set State.show_consequences = true
	=> END
